    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Uranium, lead, lithium, rare earths and tungsten drop **raw ores**: crush them in an [Ore Crusher](processing/ore_crusher) for two dusts each. Sulfur and saltpeter drop their dusts directly.\n\nVanilla's cinnabar gives cinnabar dust, the source of mercury. Each ore can be turned off in the server config."
